    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῶνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eaten out, cavernous</i>, <i><span class="en">
